+    event the loop records after the cut belongs *after* it: a consumer adopts
+    a complete SnapshotBegin..SnapshotEnd window as a new baseline, so a live
+    event published before the window would be erased by it (a store lost, a
+    removed page resurrected), and a live ``BlockStored`` published inside the
