+"""CPU checks for the exact decoder trim's far-chunk skip.
+
+An extend that ends at or below page_floor(P) - R runs only a SKIP_TAIL-row
+late tail and raises the request's late floor G to its end. The replay below
+drives the production floors and tails (late_tail_floors, late_layer_tail_layout)
+and the radix cache's claim update (exact_trim_after_extend) over random
+chunkings, and tracks row by row whether each late layer equals full prefill.
+"""
+
